land-atlas/alabama/marengo-county"],["ARC or PLC in Marengo County","/arc-plc/alabama/marengo-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Marengo County came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 36 of the 75 years on record since 1951. In 2025, August to September on the middle came in at 24% of normal, and November to December at 41%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, and grid 14869 got down to 54% of normal that year.</p>"}
